{"unit_id":"securstack__securstack-dsh-plugin#card-zh","repo":"securstack/securstack-dsh-plugin","commit":"234fe4847a8577bd57cb861b6ea792337b817ece","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@securstack/dsh-plugin 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 的 SecurStack CLI 适配插件。它向 DSH 注册仓库扫描、环境诊断和策略检查工具，并将 CLI 的 JSON 结果转换为工具输出。扫描可指定仓库路径、扫描引擎、语言和上传模式；诊断工具返回标准输出与错误输出；策略工具可按风险分数及严重级别数量设限。适合希望在 DSH 工作流中发起代码仓库检查并读取结果的开发者。需要安装 SecurStack CLI 或允许插件获取受管 CLI，并配置 CLI 所需的账户凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:46-117","src/cli-manager.ts:31-85"]}
{"unit_id":"securstack__securstack-dsh-plugin#card-en","repo":"securstack/securstack-dsh-plugin","commit":"234fe4847a8577bd57cb861b6ea792337b817ece","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@securstack/dsh-plugin connects DSH to SecurStack CLI. Its tools run repository scans, diagnostics, and policy checks, returning JSON findings or diagnostic text. Scans accept a path and optional engines; policy checks apply risk and severity limits. A CLI and its credentials are required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:46-117","src/cli-manager.ts:31-85"]}
